# Rewritten by vault-snapshot.py every run, including its own timestamp —
# tracking it would mean a commit every run forever, forever, for no reason.
AIOS/generated/git-status.md

# Per-script run logs (scriptlog.py) — pure runtime history, same reasoning
# as git-status.md above, plus: error text can echo a real local path (this
# happened — a git-lock error leaked a real machine path into a tracked
# file). Never ship these.
AIOS/history/scripts/
